Spec: Pending registration client wire contract

Purpose:
  Build bounded registration/query requests and expose validated immutable pending results.

Owns:
  ./RegistrationReply.java

References:
  ./ControlReply.sdd
  ./ManifestContract.sdd

Must:
  Require application-supplied operation UUIDs, preserve correlation and enforce manifest/frame byte limits before transport.
  Require exact pending result/diff fields, bounded unique service IDs and approvalRequired `true`.
  Validate operation status against the requested operation UUID; do not invent success for unknown states.
  Share pending-result validation with the registry and never reflect raw server messages/details.
